;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CIME Problems and Solutions\"> All CIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:MAC_Notice&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:MAC Notice (page does not exist)\">Template:MAC Notice</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017035031\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 548/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1479/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 112/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 19191/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.092      1 -total\n 83.16%   12.551      1 Template:CIME_box\n 15.28%    2.306      1 Template:MAC_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20426:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017035031 and revision id 251102. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}